    {
      "id": "p0216-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In English, \"abracadabra\" is a customary, well-known magic word that can be used in just about any magic-related situation. Because \"abracadabra\" is well known in Japan too, this magic word remained the same in Underta/e's Japanese script.",
        "raw": "In English, \"abracadabra\" is a customary, well-known magic word that can\nbe used in just about any magic-related situation. Because \"abracadabra\" is\nwell known in Japan too, this magic word remained the same in Underta/e's\nJapanese script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29406172,
          0.41015,
          0.87441291,
          0.47895
