    {
      "id": "p0216-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In English, \"alakazam\" is another standard, well-known magic word. This word is less known in Japan, however, so the localization team replaced \"alakazam\" with chichinpui, a magic-like Japanese phrase often said to children to soothe their pain after getting hurt.",
        "raw": "In English, \"alakazam\" is another standard, well-known magic word. This\nword is less known in Japan, however, so the localization team replaced\n\"alakazam\" with chichinpui, a magic-like Japanese phrase often said to children\nto soothe their pain after getting hurt.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28900925,
          0.52036429,
          0.89906405,
          0.58813571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28697196,
