    {
      "id": "p0216-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Another of Madjick's phrases, \"tinkle tinkle hoy\", isn't a commonly known magic word in English. In the translation spreadsheet, Toby noted that \"tinkle tinkle hoy\" is actually a reference to a magic phrase in the Japanese manga series, Oyasumi Pun Pun. Naturally, the localization team ensured that this reference remained intact in the Japanese script.",
        "raw": "Another of Madjick's phrases, \"tinkle\ntinkle hoy\", isn't a commonly known\nmagic word in English. In the\ntranslation spreadsheet, Toby noted\nthat \"tinkle tinkle hoy\" is actually a\nreference to a magic phrase in the\nJapanese manga series, Oyasumi Pun\nPun. Naturally, the localization team\nensured that this reference remained\nintact in the Japanese script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29412283,
          0.63059286,
          0.5816958,
          0.80755
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28697196,
          0.62987857,
          0.58302003,
          0.80862143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          24,
          25,
          26,
          27,
          28,
          29,
          30,
          31,
          32,
          34
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Madjick 的另一句“tinkle tinkle hoy”并不是英语里常见的咒语。Toby 在翻译表格中注明，它其实引用了日本漫画《Oyasumi Pun Pun》（晚安，布布）里的魔法短句。团队自然确保日文版保留了这个引用。",
        "status": "draft",
